Error [jet.ForeignFilterSelector]: `--filter=billing...` is not a Jet workspace selector
 Why: Jet rejects pnpm-style `--filter` pattern DSLs; Jet uses exact `-p <member>` and computed `--affected` / `--affected-since <ref>` instead.
 Fix: Use `-p <member>` (repeatable) or `--affected` / `--affected-since <ref>`.
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E1296
